For this task, I used a free presentation/design tool (such as Canva, Prezi, or Miro) to create a single infographic that visually summarizes key aspects of digital literacy. The infographic covers three main topics:

What Digital Literacy Is – understanding skills needed to use technology responsibly and effectively.

Useful Digital Tools for Students – highlighting platforms that support learning, collaboration, and productivity.

Safe Internet Practices – emphasizing privacy, security, and responsible online behavior.

